##### Q8 (cloudflare gpt-oss-20b, v4 prompt, 1 run): Who was the most consistent driver in the 2024 races?
== run 1 ==
  step 1 SQL: SELECT r.Abbreviation, ds.full_name, STDDEV_SAMP(r.Position) AS stddev_pos
FROM results r
JOIN driver_seasons ds ON r.Abbreviation = ds.driver_code AND r.season = ds.season
WHERE r.session = 'R' AND r.Position IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY r.Abbreviation, ds.full_name
ORDER BY stddev_pos ASC
LIMIT 10;
steps=1 ANSWER: 'The driver with the lowest standard deviation of finishing positions across the 2024 race season was **Valtteri\u202fBottas** (full name “Valtteri Bottas”), with a position‑standard deviation of about **2.22**. This indicates the most consistent race results among all drivers who finished races that season.'
